Come to think of it I like that one even better. Less exciting but
more in the spirit of Nethack. Plus I like the idea of growing your
own trees. (You'd have to dump a potion of water on it as well,
though, in order for it to grow.)

drop what? p
You drop the peach pit into the pit.
You climb out of the pit.
The boulder fills the pit.
throw what? w
You throw the potion of water downwards. -more-
The potion shatters! -more-
You sense a very faint vibration in the ground below your feet.

...or something like that, just to let unspoiled players know they're
on the right track. Holy water should make trees grow twice as fast,
unholy water prevent them from growing at all.

Every time you dig a pit, there should be a 1/20 chance of finding a
<foo> pit in the pit. I don't think it's prone to abuse because it
would take forever to grow the resultant trees and you hardly get any
fruit from them anyway. It's just a cute feature.

